cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "GeoPathSampleR" in publications use:'
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
title: 'GeoPathSampleR: Posterior Sampling of Geolocator Paths'
version: 0.1.0.9000
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21944194
abstract: Reconstructs bird migration trajectories from stationary-period likelihood
  maps built with GeoPressureR. A Gibbs sampler combines residence-dependent departure,
  a ground-speed distribution conditional on movement, and a prior on cumulative route
  distance between long periods. Provides posterior stay summaries and sampling diagnostics.
